@startuml kairos-view-fellowship-details-sequence
title View Fellowship List and Detail

actor Pastor
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Pastor -> WebAdmin: Open Fellowships list
WebAdmin -> API: GET /fellowships?branchId=...
API -> DB: SELECT fellowships
DB --> API: List
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {fellowships}

Pastor -> WebAdmin: Click a Fellowship
WebAdmin -> API: GET /fellowships/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT fellowship + members + meetings + notes
DB --> API: Detail
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {detail}

WebAdmin --> Pastor: Show Fellowship Detail

@enduml
